{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27278","headline":"题东林寺寄江州李员外 · 章孝标","name":"题东林寺寄江州李员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山势棱层入杳冥，寺形高下趂山行。\n象牙牀坐莲花佛，玛瑙函盛贝叶经。\n日映砌阴移宝阁，风吹天乐动金铃。\n门前更有清江水，便是浔阳太守厅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}